{"seq":5,"slug":"risk-management-quant","title":"量化风险管理","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 量化风险管理\n\n量化风险管理是现代金融体系的核心支柱，通过数学模型、统计方法和计算技术，对金融风险进行识别、度量、监控和缓释。从 1990 年代 J.P. Morgan 推出 RiskMetrics 体系开始，量化风险管理经历了从简单的方差-协方差方法到复杂的蒙特卡洛模拟、从单一资产 VaR 到全组合风险归因的深刻演进。\n\n2008 年全球金融危机暴露了传统风险模型的重大缺陷——对尾部风险的低估、对相关性突变的忽视、对系统性风险传染的盲区。此后，Basel III/IV 框架的推出、FRTB（Fundamental Review of the Trading Book）的实施，以及 XVA 体系的兴起，标志着风险管理进入了更为审慎和全面的新阶段。\n\n当前，量化风险管理正在经历三大变革：一是机器学习与深度学习技术的深度融入，使得非线性风险模式的识别能力大幅提升；二是气候金融风险的量化评估成为监管焦点，TCFD 框架和气候压力测试日益普及；三是系统性风险的宏观审慎监管工具不断完善，从网络分析到 CoVaR 等创新指标正在重塑风险监控体系。\n\n本知识库从风险度量基础出发，涵盖组合风险管理、监管框架和现代风险管理前沿，为构建系统性的量化风险管理知识体系提供完整路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"risk-measures","title":"风险度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"var-cvar","title":"VaR 与 CVaR 风险度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/var-cvar"},{"seq":2,"slug":"volatility-models","title":"波动率模型与 GARCH 族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/volatility-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tail-risk","title":"尾部风险与极值理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/tail-risk"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"portfolio-risk","title":"组合风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"correlation-models","title":"相关性建模与 Copula 方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/correlation-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stress-testing","title":"压力测试与情景分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/stress-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-attribution","title":"风险归因与分解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/portfolio-risk/risk-attribution"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"regulatory-framework","title":"监管框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"basel-framework","title":"Basel III/IV 资本框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/basel-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-risk-regulation","title":"市场风险监管与 FRTB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/market-risk-regulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"counterparty-risk","title":"交对手信用风险与 XVA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/regulatory-framework/counterparty-risk"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-risk","title":"现代风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/modern-risk","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ml-risk-management","title":"机器学习在风险管理中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/modern-risk/ml-risk-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"systemic-risk","title":"系统性风险与宏观审慎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/modern-risk/systemic-risk"},{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-financial-risk","title":"气候金融风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/modern-risk/climate-financial-risk"}]}]}